  "description": "As Per Map G1 - Mixed Species Reduce crowns of 2x Olive trees to create uniformed single tree ??? G1 mixed species is located within the grounds of the property as shown on the site plan provided. ??? The works are part of a regular maintenance program to retain the trees at a suitable size for their location. ??? Works promote well balanced crowns for future years. G2 - Mixed Species Crown Lift all ash to 3m and reduce sycamore to previous Reduction points by removal of upto 2.5m in branch length ??? G2 mixed species is located within the grounds of the property as shown on the site plan provided. ??? The works are part of a regular maintenance program to retain the trees at a suitable size for their location. ??? Works promote well balanced crowns for future years. G3 - Mixed Species Reduce crowns by upto 1m in order to balance and reduce encroachment to footway ??? G3 mixed species is located within the grounds of the property as shown on the site plan provided. ??? The works are part of a regular maintenance program to retain the trees at a suitable size for their location. ??? Works promote well balanced crowns for future years. T1 - Fig Crown Reduction of height and spread by 2 metres. ??? T1 Fig is located within the grounds of the property as shown on the site plan provided. ??? The works are part of a regular maintenance program to retain the trees at a suitable size for their location. ??? Works promote well balanced crowns for future years. T2 - Silver Birch Crown Lift to 3 metres above ground level. ALL ITEMS INCLUDING REMOVING ARISING DEBRIS, LEAVING SITE CLEAN AND TIDY. ??? T2 silver birch is located within the grounds of the property as shown on the site plan provided. ??? The works are part of a regular maintenance program to retain the trees at a suitable size for their location. ??? Works promote well balanced crowns for future years.",
